          <li><a href="https://support.google.com/nonprofits/answer/9314402" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-mcgennis-gold">Ad Grants account compliance requirements</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://support.google.com/nonprofits/answer/117827" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-mcgennis-gold">Managing your Ad Grants account</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.google.com/nonprofits/about/faq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-mcgennis-gold">Google for Nonprofits FAQ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

